\pard\b\fs20 Phobos Station\b0\par
\fs16\par
The first teams have already colonized Mars. As progress continues, an early warning system for meteorites from space is to be installed on Phobos and Deimos. You have been assigned to team Phobos.\par
The surface is relatively flat apart from the hill, and gravity is even lower than on Mars. Since there are hardly any raw materials, more supply probes have to be ordered, so be very sparing with jetpack flights.\par
Unfortunately, a supply unit orbiting Mars was hit by a meteorite storm, which could cause a rain of debris. Be careful!\par
